<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome! This the Global Trade\nStation, or GTS for short.\rWe let you trade homies with\npeople worldwide over Nintendo WFC.\rYou wanna do a global\nhomie trade? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup!\nWelcome to the GTS!\rYou wanna do a global homie\ntrade over Nintendo Wi-Fi\fConnection? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can trade homies two\nways at the GTS.\rYou can put a homie up for trade,\nor search through homies on the block.\rWant me to break it down\nmore? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You put up the homie\nyou tryna trade.\rThen you say what homie\nyou want back.\rIf another player got the homie\nyou want and want your\fhomie, the deal go through.\rWant me to explain anythin’\nelse? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can search through the homies\nother Hustlers put up.\rThey all say what homie\nthey want back.\rIf you find one you want, you\ngotta have the kinda\fhomie they askin’ for.\rWant me to explain anythin’\nelse? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna make a global\nhomie trade? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come back anytime.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enjoy your visit\nto the GTS!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Uh-oh!\rMy bad, but your team and all\nyour PC Boxes full.\rTo use the GTS, you gotta\nhave room on your team or in a Box.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Uh-oh!\nYou only got one homie with you.\rTo use the GTS, you gotta\nhave at least two homies on you.\rCome back with more homies\non your team.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Small world, huh?\rEh? Wait, this a miniature?\nThe real Earth is MILLIONS\fof times bigger than this?\rWhoaaaaaaa!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">They say if you link with\nsomebody, their location get\flogged on this giant globe.\fKinda like a ankle monitor.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">All I gotta do is drop a homie\nhere to trade.\rWho knows, it might get traded while\nI’m sleep tonight.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">With the gear here, you can easily\ntrade homies with other fans\fon the other side of the world!\rThat’s crazy!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can put where you live on\nthis giant globe.\rOnce you do, you can show where you at\nto anybody you link with.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Nintendo WFC so easy to use,\neven I can trade homies now!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This week, I’mma do it!\rI REALLY wanna make the Top 4 of the\nrankings.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Global Terminal got three floors.\rYou use warp panels to get from\none floor to another.\rThe blue panel take you to the GTS on\nthe ground floor.\rThe green panel go to the studios for\nBox Data and Dress-Up Data on 2F.\rThe pink panel take you to the third\nfloor for the Battle Video Gallery.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your fave is {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0},\nain’t it? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your fave is that Egg,\nain’t it? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yup, I was right!\nI KNEW it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Oh? Your fave deadass is\n{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}, ain’t it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Oh? Your fave deadass is that Egg,\nain’t it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I wanna know everybody’s fave\nkinda homie.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo, yo, yo!\rWanna let the world know about you?\nThen you gotta tell me, yo! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo, I know all I need to know\nabout you now.\rIf you wanna change your message,\nI’m the guy to see, yo!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo! You ain’t got nothin’ you\nwanna say?\rIf you wanna change your message,\nI’m the guy to see, yo!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s a few portal machines here\nat the Global Terminal.\rYou gotta put your Vs. Recorder in\nthe machines to link up.\rGo ’head and try the machines,\nthey walk you through it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Global Terminal!\rHere, you can join the huge community\nof Hustlers worldwide.\rYou can see the records of Hustlers\nlike you from all over the world.\rYou can also trade homies with the\nworld’s Hustlers.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Connect to Nintendo Wi-Fi\nConnection for Hustler Rankings? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hustler Rankings is a team-based\nrankin’ system for Hustlers around\fthe world.\rHustlers get split into a few\ngroups and ranked in mad categories.\rIf you join, your Hustler stats\nget sent to your team automatic.\rIn other words, what you do as a\nHustler can help your team’s rank.\rHeads up!\rIf you enter a rankin’ category more\nthan once, only the points from\fyour last report count.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Connect to Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection\nand check the Battle Video\fRankings? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Battle Video Rankings is a gallery of\npopular Battle Videos.\rStudy classic scraps and sharpen\nyour own Hustler skills.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">USE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">INFO</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CANCEL</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0600_T25R1201_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The green panel go to the studios\nfor Box Data and Dress-Up Data on 2F.\rThe pink panel go to the Battle\nVideo Gallery on 3F.</language>
	</row>
</body>
